; font-size: 10pt;\">- 뱁믹스</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(개인/기관 무료) :&nbsp;</span></span><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/deeppurple3/221876287833\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">https://blog.naver.com/deeppurple3/221876287833</span></a><br></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, 돋움, dotum, sans-serif; list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; (자막 기능이 아주 강력한 프로그램입니다.)</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, 돋움, dotum, sans-serif; list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">- 키네마스터(스마트폰) :&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.kinemaster.com/?lang=kr\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">https://www.kinemaster.com/?lang=kr</span></a><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://grapherstory.tistory.com/588\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">https://grapherstory.tistory.com/588</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, 돋움, dotum, sans-serif; list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, 돋움, dotum, sans-serif; list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\"><span style=\